                  "numinlets": 1,
                  "numoutlets": 0,
                  "patching_rect": [
                    470.0,
                    40.0,
                    320.0,
                    90.0
                  ],
                  "text": "y[n] = x[n] - x[n-1] + R*y[n-1] -- standard first-order DC blocker.\nR=0.9997 is a common choice at audio sample rates: close enough to 1\nto remove true DC while leaving audible content essentially untouched.\nin3 (shift) is added directly, so 0=no shift, +/- moves it that far."
                }
